{"id":"ustroit_","lemma":"устроить","pos":"verb","rank":847,"glosses":["to arrange, to organize, to establish","to settle, to set up, to put in order","to suit, to satisfy"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/62/Ru-%D1%83%D1%81%D1%82%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D1%83%D1%81%D1%82%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"устрою","2s":"устроишь","3s":"устроит","1p":"устроим","2p":"устроите","3p":"устроят"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"устрой","2p":"устройте"}}},"past":{"m":"устроил","p":"устроили","f":"устроила","n":"устроило"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"устраивать","examples":[{"text":"Ты можешь это устроить?","en":"Can you arrange it?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Кто устроил встречу?","en":"Who organized the meeting?","words":[{"g":"who"},null,{"g":"to meet","l":"встретить"}]},{"text":"Думаю, я могу это устроить.","en":"I think I can arrange that.","words":[{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Давайте устроим вечеринку.","en":"Let's throw a party.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/926757","words":[{"g":"to let"},null,null]},{"text":"Том всё устроит.","en":"Tom will arrange everything.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"everything, all"},null]}]}